activity Identify Donor
activity Initiate Contact
activity Perform Meeting
activity Compose Proposal
activity Assess Proposal
activity Authorize Proposal
activity Submit Proposal
activity Accept Response
activity Negotiate Terms
activity Finalize Agreement
bind Identify Donor: Donor Identifier
bind Initiate Contact: Donor Identifier, Contact Method
bind Perform Meeting: Donor Identifier, Meeting Duration
bind Compose Proposal: Donor Identifier, Donation Amount, Proposal State
bind Assess Proposal: Donor Identifier, Proposal State
bind Authorize Proposal: Donor Identifier, Proposal State
bind Submit Proposal: Donor Identifier, Proposal State
bind Accept Response: Donor Identifier, Response Category
bind Negotiate Terms: Donor Identifier, Response Category
bind Finalize Agreement: Donor Identifier, Agreement State
Donor Identifier: integer between 1 and 1000
Donation Amount: float between 1000.0 and 1000000.0
Contact Method: Email, Phone, In-Person
Proposal State: Drafted, Reviewed, Approved, Submitted
Meeting Duration: integer between 15 and 180
Response Category: Positive, Negative, Neutral
Agreement State: Pending, Finalized
Init[Identify Donor] | |
End[Finalize Agreement] | |
Existence[Assess Proposal] | |
Precedence[Submit Proposal, Authorize Proposal] | |A.Donor Identifier == T.Donor Identifier |
Response[Accept Response, Negotiate Terms] | |A.Donor Identifier == T.Donor Identifier |0,2,d
Chain Response[Perform Meeting, Compose Proposal] | |A.Donor Identifier == T.Donor Identifier |0,48,h
Responded Existence[Submit Proposal, Accept Response] | |A.Donor Identifier == T.Donor Identifier |
Precedence[Assess Proposal, Compose Proposal] | |A.Donor Identifier == T.Donor Identifier |
Co-Existence[Initiate Contact, Perform Meeting] |A.Contact Method is Phone |A.Contact Method == T.Contact Method |
Not Chain Succession[Accept Response, Finalize Agreement] |A.Response Category is Negative |A.Donor Identifier == T.Donor Identifier |